WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:09.768
Whether you have a prior consultation makes a big difference in both how polished the final look is and how satisfied you feel on the day.

2
00:00:10.104 --> 00:00:15.072
Is it really safe to meet for the first time on the wedding day with no preparation and just say, "I'll leave it up to you"?

3
00:00:15.408 --> 00:00:23.640
This often results in a one-size-fits-all look that ignores each person's bone structure and skin, leading to regrets like, "I can't even look at the photos from my first child's wedding."

4
00:00:23.976 --> 00:00:29.304
With a prior consultation, on the other hand, a personal chart is created just for you.

5
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:38.976
The artist assesses your skin condition and hair tension in advance and prepares the right products and techniques, which makes the final makeup far more polished.

6
00:00:39.312 --> 00:00:44.472
Since the best style has already been tested beforehand, there's virtually no chance of it not working out.

7
00:00:44.808 --> 00:00:53.472
While same-day makeup is all about speed, a prior consultation is what builds a truly customized look that lifts a wedding parent's confidence.
